From: Wisbendji Fimerlus <archledger236@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] window: Expose the requested geometry to scripts

SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 Wisbendji Fimerlus <archledger236@gmail.com>
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later

Upstream: https://invent.kde.org/plasma/kwin/-/merge_requests/10225
Commit: 3fd6cdb85cc2b7d562fbb403c035709462c0068a (proposed, not merged)
Bug: https://bugs.kde.org/show_bug.cgi?id=527821

Backport to KWin 6.7.5. The three integration tests are unchanged.
6.7.5 handles xdg-shell geometry in XdgSurfaceWindow, shared with
picture-in-picture windows, rather than in each role. Notify at the
end of that shared commit handler. Retain 6.7.5's existing geometry
synchronization rules and describe them in its property documentation.
No configure, tile-ownership or output-transfer behavior is changed.

---
